r life — morning routine, leaving the house, pre-meeting check — or pick a ready-made one from the built-in library. Every task gets a priority: mandatory, regular, or optional.\n\nBETTER SAFE. NEVER SORRY.\nChecking off takes some time: a deliberate hold instead of an accidental tick. And the essential things — meds, keys, stove — need to be confirmed up to three times. No chance for your brain wandering off ever again. No autopilot.\n\nGOOD RIDDANCE, TIME BLINDNESS\nNoggi shows your \"must do\" and \"could do\" minutes separately and tells you exactly when you'll be done. No more guessing about being ready.\n\nNO TRACKING. NO PRESSURE.\nNo streaks to keep, no goals to chase, no statistics judging you. Noggi doesn't want you to do more — it wants you to stop worrying about what you might have missed.\n\nNOTHING TO CANCEL HERE\nNo account you'd forget. No subscription you forget to cancel. Free from distracting ads. Just pay once, use forever — and everything stays on your device.\n\nMADE FOR REAL BRAINS\nBuilt for moments where every extra decision costs energy. Adjustable hold duration, confirmation difficulty, reduced motion, and full support for English and German.\n\nHope this helps.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "sellerUrl": "https://www.noggi.app", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "2334720", "formattedPrice": "￦1,100", "trackContentRating": "4+", "minimumOsVersion": "15.0", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "userRatingCount": 0}]}